  "description": "Raytheon was a recent stock purchase...here are the steps that led to a buy",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to <strong>StockTok</strong></em>! As many of you already know, I picked up Raytheon <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RTX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> yesterday, 16 June 2025. Raytheon is a more popular name…but the question arose: “<strong>How do you find these stocks</strong>” in particular for some of the lesser known names. Obviously, manually scrolling 5000+ tickers every single day…is IMPOSSIBLE.  </p><p>Recall, the screener operates off relative strength (not relative strength index, that is different!). Relative strength is how well that asset’s price action is performing, relative to all the other tickers in the market. Obviously, we want stocks that are showing extreme resilience or preferably strength. Next, we want an early breakout from a consolidation zone. More details of how the screener operates can be found the “<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a>”.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg\" width=\"564\" height=\"317\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:317,&quot;width&quot;:564,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:37364,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/166145633?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eprZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8fb36ad3-bcda-46ff-ba81-c4c153cc18c1_564x317.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Stocks breaking out of bullish consolidations offer the highest probability of continued upward trend. The screener is largely modeled after Mark Minervini’s Specific Entry Point Analysis (SEPA) model. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Next, we just follow some very basic fundamental rules which you (or I) can quickly scan. Does the company have positive earnings? Positive cashflow? Is the ticker a known name? It doesn’t have to be super popular like Meta…or even Raytheon in this case…but it can’t be a ghost of a company that will need a few more years to get both institutional and retail investment. </p><p>Keep it simple…don’t make it harder than it has to be. As always, these are my thoughts and opinions…you do what is best for you. Questions are always welcome in the chat! Thanks for stopping by!</p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p></p>",
